{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "solution-tabs",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "display",
      "content",
      "interactive",
      "tabs"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/solution-tabs-docs"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "Initiale Implementierung: Tab-basierte Loesungsuebersicht mit reichem Panel (Titel, Text, Feature-Liste, CTA) und Produkt-Visual (Mock-UI)",
          "Orientation-Achse: horizontal (Tab-Leiste oben) / vertical (nummerierte Seitennavigation)",
          "Variant-Achse: line (Underline) / contained (gefuellte Tabs)",
          "Autoplay-Achse: off / on (Auto-Rotation mit Fortschrittsbalken, pausiert bei Hover/Fokus)",
          "Pro-Panel Akzentfarbe via --nc-solution-tabs-accent (Inline-Override)",
          "Tastatur: Pfeiltasten navigieren, Enter/Space aktiviert; ARIA tablist/tab/tabpanel",
          "prefers-reduced-motion: Animationen und Autoplay deaktiviert"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "layer": "organism",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/07-organisms/_solution-tabs.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/organisms/solution-tabs.stories.js",
      "arena": null,
      "drupal": [
        "block--block-content--neo-solution-tabs.html.twig",
        "block--inline-block--neo-solution-tabs.html.twig"
      ],
      "docs": null
    }
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-solution-tabs"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "tablist",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__tablist",
        "optional": false,
        "description": "Tab-Leiste. role='tablist'. Horizontal oben oder vertikal seitlich (--vertical)."
      },
      {
        "name": "tab",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__tab",
        "optional": false,
        "description": "Einzelner Tab. button[role='tab'] mit aria-selected/aria-controls. Enthaelt optionalen Index und Progress-Indikator."
      },
      {
        "name": "progress",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__progress",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Fortschrittsbalken im aktiven Tab bei Autoplay; im Vertikal-Modus statischer Akzent-Indikator."
      },
      {
        "name": "panel",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__panel",
        "optional": false,
        "description": "Tab-Panel. role='tabpanel'. Sichtbar via .is-active. Grid aus Inhalt + Produkt-Visual."
      },
      {
        "name": "panel-title",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__panel-title",
        "optional": false,
        "description": "Panel-Ueberschrift (h3)."
      },
      {
        "name": "features",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__features",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Feature-Liste mit gestaffelter Einblendung."
      },
      {
        "name": "cta",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__cta",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Call-to-Action-Button im Panel."
      },
      {
        "name": "visual",
        "element": ".nc-solution-tabs__visual",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Produkt-Visual (Mock-UI mit Chip, Name, Skeleton-Linien). Dekorativ, aria-hidden."
      }
    ],
    "domNotes": [
      "Root .nc-solution-tabs setzt --nc-solution-tabs-accent (Default = -accent-default), per Panel via Inline-Style ueberschreibbar.",
      "Tablist role='tablist'; horizontal (flex row) oder vertikal (--vertical, flex column, border-inline-start).",
      "Tab button[role='tab'][aria-selected][aria-controls]; aktives Panel .is-active (display:grid).",
      "Autoplay: data-autoplay='on' am Root; Progress-Balken animiert ueber --nc-solution-tabs-autoplay-duration; .is-paused pausiert (Hover/Fokus). JS rotiert die Tabs.",
      "Vertikal: Progress wird zum vertikalen Akzent-Indikator (scaleY); Visual steht oben (order:-1).",
      "Variant contained: gefuellte Tabs ohne Underline/Progress.",
      "Tastatur: ArrowLeft/Right (horizontal) bzw. ArrowUp/Down (vertikal) navigiert; Enter/Space aktiviert.",
      "Responsive 880px: Panel einspaltig, Tablist horizontal scrollbar.",
      "prefers-reduced-motion: keine Panel-/Feature-Animation, kein Autoplay-Progress."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "orientation": {
      "label": "Orientation",
      "description": "Anordnung der Tab-Leiste",
      "values": {
        "horizontal": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "layout"
          ],
          "renderHint": "solution-tabs-horizontal"
        },
        "vertical": {
          "modifier": "nc-solution-tabs--vertical",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "layout"
          ],
          "renderHint": "solution-tabs-vertical"
        }
      }
    },
    "variant": {
      "label": "Variant",
      "description": "Visuelle Tab-Darstellung",
      "values": {
        "line": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "tabs"
          ],
          "renderHint": "solution-tabs-line"
        },
        "contained": {
          "modifier": "nc-solution-tabs--contained",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "tabs"
          ],
          "renderHint": "solution-tabs-contained"
        }
      }
    },
    "autoplay": {
      "label": "Autoplay",
      "description": "Automatische Tab-Rotation mit Fortschrittsbalken",
      "values": {
        "off": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "solution-tabs-autoplay-off"
        },
        "on": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "tabs"
          ],
          "renderHint": "solution-tabs-autoplay-on"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "active",
      "focus"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "active",
      "focus",
      "hover",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [],
      "note": "ARIA Tabs-Pattern: tablist/tab/tabpanel, aria-selected, aria-controls, Roving-Tabindex. Pfeiltasten navigieren, Enter/Space aktiviert. Autoplay pausiert bei Hover/Fokus. Produkt-Visual dekorativ (aria-hidden). Panel-Titel h3 (Sektions-h2 davor)."
    },
    "overrides": []
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "role-tablist",
          "role-tab",
          "role-tabpanel",
          "aria-selected",
          "aria-controls",
          "keyboard-navigation"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Tabs-Pattern: jeder Tab kontrolliert ein Panel; genau ein Tab aktiv (Roving-Tabindex)."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-solution-tabs"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "layout"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "layout": {
        "label": "Layout & Surface",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-solution-tabs-border",
          "nc-solution-tabs-visual-bg"
        ]
      },
      "tabs": {
        "label": "Tabs & Autoplay",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-solution-tabs-tab-color",
          "nc-solution-tabs-tab-color-active",
          "nc-solution-tabs-autoplay-duration"
        ]
      },
      "accent": {
        "label": "Accent & Text",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-solution-tabs-accent-default",
          "nc-solution-tabs-title",
          "nc-solution-tabs-text"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "komposition": [
    { "art": "enthaelt", "recipe": "bento-grid" },
    { "art": "enthaelt", "recipe": "button" },
    { "art": "enthaelt", "recipe": "expanding-panels" },
    { "art": "enthaelt", "recipe": "tab-nav" }
  ],
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "horizontal-autoplay",
      "label": "Horizontal + Autoplay",
      "description": "Tab-Leiste oben, Auto-Rotation mit Fortschrittsbalken, reiches Panel + Produkt-Visual.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "line"
          ],
          "autoplay": [
            "on"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "active"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "layout",
        "tabs",
        "accent"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "orientation",
        "colAxis": "variant"
      },
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "solution-tabs",
        "label": "horizontal + autoplay"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Aktiver Tab deutlich unterscheidbar; Panel-Text 4.5:1."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vertical",
      "label": "Vertikale Navigation",
      "description": "Nummerierte Seitennavigation links, gleitendes Panel rechts.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "vertical"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "line"
          ],
          "autoplay": [
            "off"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "active"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "layout",
        "tabs",
        "accent"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "orientation",
        "colAxis": "variant"
      },
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "solution-tabs",
        "label": "vertical"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Aktiver Eintrag mit Akzent-Indikator; Pfeiltasten vertikal."
      }
    }
  ]
}
